            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KILL, BUILD, DRIVE, DO PARKOUR, MAKE FRIENDS, PILOT, EAT. </h2>Stand Out thrusts you headfirst into a relentless battle for supremacy, custom-made for those who live for the battleground. Imagine descending from the heavens, parachute billowing in the wind, as you touch down on a sprawling island ripe for exploration. Your mission: unearth the weaponry and gear necessary for an epic struggle to stay alive.<br>Utilize high-speed vehicles to traverse the battlefield with unparalleled agility. But beware! The omnipresent, deadly force field relentlessly encloses the arena, forcing combatants into a deadly dance of survival and elimination. As the tension escalates, the last warrior standing will claim victory and eternal glory. Will it be you?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748370/extras/e2e2e19f559aa4b934fbeb354e73faa1.avif?t=1697660924\" width=616 height=204 /></span><br> <br>Our game has been meticulously crafted to deliver the quintessential VR combat showdown. It boasts an extensive array of weapons that cater to every imaginable fighting style, ranging from razor-sharp blades to precision sniper rifles.<br><br>Immerse yourself in the adrenaline-pumping action across three meticulously crafted maps, each inspired by real-world locations. These environments will thrust you into epic combat scenarios, whether you find yourself amidst dense forests, expansive plains, desolate abandoned towns, or even a chilling nuclear site. Brace yourself for an unparalleled combat experience that spans the spectrum of warfare landscapes.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748370/extras/7013779d15c371fcb2c89ed1587146b5.avif?t=1697660924\" width=616 height=204 /></span><br> <br>Prepare to navigate treacherous trenches, strategically evading enemy fire as you crawl through the mud. Ascend the crumbling ruins to secure a vantage point that offers a clear line of sight, giving you the edge in the battle ahead. Engage in heart-pounding gunfights that will see you chasing down your opponents on winding mountain roads, with motorcycles and cars serving as your adrenaline-fueled steeds.<br><br>In this relentless battle, victory demands unwavering determination. You must be willing to employ any means necessary to emerge as the triumphant survivor.<br><br>Embrace the cycle of life, death, and growth as you embark on this journey. Each defeat becomes a lesson, each setback a stepping stone toward becoming the ultimate last man or women standing. Will you have what it takes to rise to the top of the leaderboard?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This Is Battle Royale.</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748370/extras/60d943aaf23bc3119d8e70608c7c9abc.poster.avif?t=1697660924\" width=626 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748370/extras/60d943aaf23bc3119d8e70608c7c9abc.webm?t=1697660924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748370/extras/60d943aaf23bc3119d8e70608c7c9abc.mp4?t=1697660924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748370/extras/4dbb6fdcd12790a3246e88f92d303aba.avif?t=1697660924\" width=616 height=204 /></span>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KILL, BUILD, DRIVE, DO PARKOUR, MAKE FRIENDS, PILOT, EAT. </h2>Stand Out thrusts you headfirst into a relentless battle for supremacy, custom-made for those who live for the battleground. Imagine descending from the heavens, parachute billowing in the wind, as you touch down on a sprawling island ripe for exploration. Your mission: unearth the weaponry and gear necessary for an epic struggle to stay alive.<br>Utilize high-speed vehicles to traverse the battlefield with unparalleled agility. But beware! The omnipresent, deadly force field relentlessly encloses the arena, forcing combatants into a deadly dance of survival and elimination. As the tension escalates, the last warrior standing will claim victory and eternal glory. Will it be you?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748370/extras/e2e2e19f559aa4b934fbeb354e73faa1.avif?t=1697660924\" width=616 height=204 /></span><br> <br>Our game has been meticulously crafted to deliver the quintessential VR combat showdown. It boasts an extensive array of weapons that cater to every imaginable fighting style, ranging from razor-sharp blades to precision sniper rifles.<br><br>Immerse yourself in the adrenaline-pumping action across three meticulously crafted maps, each inspired by real-world locations. These environments will thrust you into epic combat scenarios, whether you find yourself amidst dense forests, expansive plains, desolate abandoned towns, or even a chilling nuclear site. Brace yourself for an unparalleled combat experience that spans the spectrum of warfare landscapes.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748370/extras/7013779d15c371fcb2c89ed1587146b5.avif?t=1697660924\" width=616 height=204 /></span><br> <br>Prepare to navigate treacherous trenches, strategically evading enemy fire as you crawl through the mud. Ascend the crumbling ruins to secure a vantage point that offers a clear line of sight, giving you the edge in the battle ahead. Engage in heart-pounding gunfights that will see you chasing down your opponents on winding mountain roads, with motorcycles and cars serving as your adrenaline-fueled steeds.<br><br>In this relentless battle, victory demands unwavering determination. You must be willing to employ any means necessary to emerge as the triumphant survivor.<br><br>Embrace the cycle of life, death, and growth as you embark on this journey. Each defeat becomes a lesson, each setback a stepping stone toward becoming the ultimate last man or women standing. Will you have what it takes to rise to the top of the leaderboard?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This Is Battle Royale.</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748370/extras/60d943aaf23bc3119d8e70608c7c9abc.poster.avif?t=1697660924\" width=626 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748370/extras/60d943aaf23bc3119d8e70608c7c9abc.webm?t=1697660924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748370/extras/60d943aaf23bc3119d8e70608c7c9abc.mp4?t=1697660924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748370/extras/4dbb6fdcd12790a3246e88f92d303aba.avif?t=1697660924\" width=616 height=204 /></span>",
